# Create PR

When the user runs this command: push the current branch if needed, then run:

```bash
gh pr create --fill
```

Offer `--draft` or `--web` if relevant.

## Documentation section

Awell source repos require every PR to either carry a `[DOCUMENTATION]` block in its description or
carry the `docs-skip` label. Fold that choice into the `gh pr create` call above — append the block
to the body for customer-facing changes, or add `--label docs-skip` for non-customer-facing ones.

For the contract (block fields, opt-out rules), load the author-facing skill from `awell-docs`:

```bash
gh api repos/awell-health/awell-docs/contents/skills/triggering-doc-updates/SKILL.md --jq '.content' | base64 -d
```
